{%- comment -%}
  Collection card — one template, rendered once per collection.

  **This is a single block, not one per collection.** The section holds the list
  of collections and renders this static block inside its own loop, handing each
  pass the collection it is for:

      {% content_for 'block', type: '_collection-card', id: 'collection-card',
                     closest.collection: collection %}

  So four collections show four cards from one set of settings, and the theme
  editor lists it once with the repeat mark. Anything that would have to differ
  per card — a title override, a chosen photograph — therefore has no place
  here; those come from the collection itself.

  Its name is underscored because it is **private**: a merchant never adds it,
  the section places it. Only its children are in an "Add block" list.

  The heading row is a real layout-block composition, not card-specific CSS:
  its private header wrapper uses the global Group layout contract, a nested
  global Group holds the global Text name and Icon arrow, and a private
  collection-count Text supplies the contextual value without leaking a mode
  into the global Text block.

  The hover reveal is a behavior of the card, not content in the block tree.
  Its switch and label therefore live on this Collection card and the card
  emits the overlay itself.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign collection = closest.collection
  assign url = collection.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
-%}

<a class="cat-card" href="{{ url }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% content_for 'blocks' %}
  {%- if block.settings.show_hover_reveal -%}
    <span class="cat-card__reveal" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="cat-card__reveal-row">
        <span class="cat-card__reveal-label">{{ block.settings.hover_reveal_label }}</span>
        <span class="cat-card__reveal-arrow">{% render 'icon', icon: 'arrow-right' %}</span>
      </span>
    </span>
  {%- endif -%}
</a>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.collection_card.name",
  "tag": null,
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "_collection-card-media" },
    { "type": "_collection-card-header" }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_hover_reveal",
      "label": "t:blocks.collection_card.hover_reveal.label",
      "info": "t:blocks.collection_card.hover_reveal.info",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "hover_reveal_label",
      "label": "t:blocks.collection_card.hover_reveal_label.label",
      "default": "View pieces",
      "visible_if": "{{ block.settings.show_hover_reveal }}"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
